  {"id": "document:packages/client/hmr/README.md", "type": "document", "name": "README.md", "filePath": "packages/client/hmr/README.md", "summary": "dsh-client-hmr 包 README：让打开的 Web 页与 Host 插件图保持同步并重载重建的浏览器 bundle——普通插件启停不重载页面不重启 Host 即生效；代码重建以全新组件状态替换受影响插件；模型看不到新输入输出。", "tags": ["documentation", "hmr", "plugin-graph-sync"], "complexity": "simple"},
