  {"id": "document:packages/client/modules/README.md", "type": "document", "name": "README.md", "filePath": "packages/client/modules/README.md", "summary": "dsh-client-modules 包 README：把插件包的 dsh.client 声明变成可加载浏览器 bundle——host 半体扫描启用的 Loader 条目组合 boot 图，可用 Web 载体经 /plugins 服务各 bundle，shell 拥有的载体经 fetchBundle() 派发同一精确响应；浏览器半体惰性按需加载，bundle 执行只注册工厂、副作用在物化时才跑；全部是浏览器内核机器，模型不可见。", "tags": ["documentation", "client-modules", "lazy-bundles"], "complexity": "moderate"},
  {"id": "config:packages/client/modules/package.json", "type": "config", "name": "package.json", "filePath": "packages/client/modules/package.json", "summary": "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-modules 包清单：浏览器模块机器的依赖与导出。", "tags": ["configuration", "package-manifest"], "complexity": "simple"},
