  {"id": "file:packages/client/modules/src/client/entries.ts", "type": "file", "name": "entries.ts", "filePath": "packages/client/modules/src/client/entries.ts", "summary": "页面拥有的 Loader 条目管理（传输无关的对账/重试/代码替换）：ClientEntries 只管理从 Host manifest 建的条目，串行队列上 sync 对账期望图（失败逐条报告不中断）、retry 重试失败项、reload 重建；替换代码前 invalidateForReplacement+tearDownEntryFiber；state 可观察快照供页面诊断。", "tags": ["loader-entries", "reconciliation", "code-replacement"], "complexity": "complex"},
  {"id": "class:packages/client/modules/src/client/entries.ts:ClientEntries", "type": "class", "name": "ClientEntries", "filePath": "packages/client/modules/src/client/entries.ts", "lineRange": [36, 263], "summary": "页面控制器：构造于 Cordis boot 前持 boot manifest 与 ReleaseChangeGate；releaseChange/dismissRelease 透传版本变更观察，enqueue 串行化条目操作，replace 以新 rev 替换条目并清理 owned styles；FiberState 常量镜像（bundle loader 不能 import const enum）。", "tags": ["page-controller", "serialized-queue", "release-gating"], "complexity": "complex"},
  {"id": "file:packages/client/modules/src/client/entry-lifecycle.ts", "type": "file", "name": "entry-lifecycle.ts", "filePath": "packages/client/modules/src/client/entry-lifecycle.ts", "summary": "活图对账与代码替换共享的 Loader 生命周期操作：tearDownEntryFiber 先释放 runtime 再清 entry fiber（注册表删除防 Loader 把替换当用户禁用），removeOwnedStyles 在 effect 清理结算后摘除插件拥有的 style 标签。", "tags": ["lifecycle-ops", "fiber-teardown"], "complexity": "simple"},
  {"id": "function:packages/client/modules/src/client/entry-lifecycle.ts:tearDownEntryFiber", "type": "function", "name": "tearDownEntryFiber", "filePath": "packages/client/modules/src/client/entry-lifecycle.ts", "lineRange": [9, 17], "summary": "等 fiber inertia 结束后删除 fiber，供 Loader refresh 导入新代码。", "tags": ["teardown"], "complexity": "simple"},
  {"id": "function:packages/client/modules/src/client/entry-lifecycle.ts:removeOwnedStyles", "type": "function", "name": "removeOwnedStyles", "filePath": "packages/client/modules/src/client/entry-lifecycle.ts", "lineRange": [23, 28], "summary": "按 data-plugin 属性摘除某包拥有的全部 style 元素。", "tags": ["style-cleanup"], "complexity": "simple"},
