  {"id": "file:packages/client/modules/src/client/release-change.ts", "type": "file", "name": "release-change.ts", "filePath": "packages/client/modules/src/client/release-change.ts", "summary": "版本变更门：页面只应用其 boot release 的 Host 图——page/previous/host 三元 ClientReleaseChange 可观察快照，mismatch 时公告（除非已 dismiss 该 Host release），插件更新等页面重载。", "tags": ["release-gating", "observable-snapshot"], "complexity": "moderate"},
