  {"id": "function:packages/client/product-analytics/src/environment-query.ts:queryEnvironment", "type": "function", "name": "queryEnvironment", "filePath": "packages/client/product-analytics/src/environment-query.ts", "lineRange": [27, 48], "summary": "执行单条固定 argv 查询：错误映射 output-limit/timeout/query-fixed 原因，同步 spawn 失败无子进程也归 query-failed。", "tags": ["execution", "error-mapping"], "complexity": "simple"},
  {"id": "file:packages/client/product-analytics/src/environment.ts", "type": "file", "name": "environment.ts", "filePath": "packages/client/product-analytics/src/environment.ts", "summary": "静态桌面环境字段采集（与账户/凭据可用性无关）：collectEnvironment 只采已批准元数据——os_name/app_arch 来自进程、Windows 版本与 CPU 物理核数经 PowerShell 注册表/CIM 查询（zod 校验）、macOS 经 sw_vers；失败源只留 dependent 字段缺失与固定原因（不带原始命令输出或错误）。", "tags": ["environment-collection", "approved-fields", "missing-reasons"], "complexity": "complex"},
