  {"id": "file:packages/client/product-analytics/src/events.ts", "type": "file", "name": "events.ts", "filePath": "packages/client/product-analytics/src/events.ts", "summary": "桌面分析事件目录：ProductEventMap 具名事件及其选定产品属性（desktop_app_launch/auth 页与点击/onboarding 页弹窗/升级下载与重启/send_button_click 含 run_mode/msg_type/is_new_session/preset 类别等），事件所有者选定字段。", "tags": ["type-definition", "event-catalog"], "complexity": "moderate"}
